# NEXUS Personal OS

A cyberpunk-inspired AI productivity terminal built using Python.

## Features

- Task management
- Mood tracking
- Focus mode
- XP & leveling system
- Persistent memory using JSON
- Cyberpunk terminal UI
- Matrix mode
- Hidden easter eggs

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Rich
- Pyfiglet
- JSON
- Streamlit

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| help | Show commands |
| task add | Add task |
| show tasks | View tasks |
| mood log | Log mood |
| motivate | Motivation quote |
| focus start | Start focus timer |
| brief today | Daily briefing |
| matrix | Secret effect |
| self destruct | Joke countdown |

## Installation

```bash
git clone YOUR_GITHUB_LINK
cd NEXUS-Personal-OS
pip install -r requirements.txt
python nexus.py
```

